{"title":"2018 MPFG Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_19\">Problem 19</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_MPFG_Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 19\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the sum\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/0/240b62e32ea68da7b45be64107ac9da7c52d1b8e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n = \\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2k-1}}\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>Determine <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/8/dd8e545b378d24a86a764a9092b8c43d2af800a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor S_{4901} \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"20\" />. Recall that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a real number, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/06681f5b345750104366c512078960fee8d81b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"19\" /> (the floor of x) is the greatest integer that is less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_MPFG_Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can think of this problem through integration perspectives. Observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/4/c74a070eea97d9363f58a257e05e75fc69efa753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> looks very similar to a Riemann sum.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/a/a9a0e004d369f1c342d1f3920467e6a74fcb875d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1}}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}+ ... + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9801}}\\]\" width=\"236\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>We first applicate the right Riemann sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b5bbfa4b3d5620435b9aa5de7034ea54246e60b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"65\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Right_rie.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/f/f9/Right_rie.jpg/750px-Right_rie.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"498\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/f/f9/Right_rie.jpg/1125px-Right_rie.jpg 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/f/f9/Right_rie.jpg 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/7/957a83ba7f7f19e7d568c0c3f7a81c3e770a8de9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2S_n &gt; \\int_{1}^{9803} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}} \\,dx\\]\" width=\"153\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f239abd737ba3da55d27fd1af4afc2ea033ff71.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2S_n &gt; \\left. (2x^{\\frac{1}{2}})\\right|_{1}^{9803}\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/b/d5b9cabd1b9220136c997c436b0f9c1e9fcf8ff0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2S_n &gt; 2(\\sqrt{9803}-1)\\]\" width=\"157\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/8/cc8a19de16c79457398d7200f4e7d3372111a206.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n &gt; \\sqrt{9803}-1\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Then applicate the left Riemann sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b5bbfa4b3d5620435b9aa5de7034ea54246e60b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"65\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:Left_rie.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/f/ff/Left_rie.jpg/750px-Left_rie.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"498\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/f/ff/Left_rie.jpg/1125px-Left_rie.jpg 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/f/ff/Left_rie.jpg 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/5/94579f10b7da9091f05dd8ef18c37a3f654589a8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2S_n-1 &lt; \\int_{1}^{9801} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}} \\,dx\\]\" width=\"184\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/3/41370ace1d9c0be85df031a0c95411d63b92bc67.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2S_n-1 &lt; \\left. (2x^{\\frac{1}{2}})\\right|_{1}^{9801}\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"36\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/c/81c52b56cae20dac843c916a2ceaf4261c215970.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n-\\frac{1}{2} &gt; \\sqrt{9801}-1\\]\" width=\"161\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/9/f99c7d4799faa9abb3e3ab9cde7f31fc0f74d89b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n &lt; \\sqrt{9801}-\\frac{1}{2}\\]\" width=\"129\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><br />\nWe conclude that:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/5/b85dee4e156e958d60af55fde0fa52c30ac24ea0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{9803}-1 &lt; S_n &lt; \\sqrt{9801}-\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"240\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/1/7d104fcbe80a3d4e2787765fd99637d4164186a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor S_n \\rfloor = \\boxed{98}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"92\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~cassphe\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018001814\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.026 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 72/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3648/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:33526:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018001814 and revision id 266919. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}